    <briefdescription>
<para>Adaptor that maps from a SCC to its functions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Designed to allow composition of a FunctionPass(Manager) and a <ref refid="namespacellvm_1a4ded4558d2b58dcdd7a1736aa69a8bc4" kindref="member">CGSCCPassManager</ref>. Note that if this pass is constructed with a pointer to a <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacellvm_1a571b2bbf074b46c75300bd8f14c5ab72" kindref="member">CGSCCAnalysisManager</ref></computeroutput> it will run the <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_function_analysis_manager_c_g_s_c_c_proxy" kindref="compound">FunctionAnalysisManagerCGSCCProxy</ref></computeroutput> analysis prior to running the function pass over the SCC to enable a <computeroutput><ref refid="namespacellvm_1adce09a5a0de0e3177eb00e932734af2f" kindref="member">FunctionAnalysisManager</ref></computeroutput> to be used within this run safely. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
